    "prompt": "Select TWO correct statements about the native VLAN on an 802.1Q trunk.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An engineer is troubleshooting intermittent connectivity issues that appear related to untagged traffic on a trunk link.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly TWO</h3></div>",
