    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>After AP installation in a multi-floor office, the wireless team must confirm that design targets have been met before handing the network over to operations.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
