    "prompt": "Select THREE best practices for maintaining network documentation accuracy over time.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The architecture team wants to reduce the number of outages caused by outdated diagrams and inventory records.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
