    "prompt": "Click the ACL line that incorrectly permits SSH from an unauthorized external host.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An administrator is reviewing an ACL applied inbound on the external interface. SSH access must be restricted exclusively to the management IP range 192.168.10.0/24.</p></div>",
