    "type": "multiselect",
    "prompt": "Select THREE URL or content-filtering capabilities that help protect users and the network.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A web-security gateway is being configured to reduce the risk of malware and data leakage via HTTP/HTTPS.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
